Description: add the missing NAME POD section to X11::korgwm::Layout
 The module ships POD starting with DESCRIPTION, so pod2man generates a manual
 page without a NAME section and lintian reports a bad whatis entry.
Forwarded: not-yet
Author: Dmitry Oboukhov <unera@debian.org>
Last-Update: 2026-10-29

--- a/lib/X11/korgwm/Layout.pm
+++ b/lib/X11/korgwm/Layout.pm
@@ -10,6 +10,10 @@
 use X11::korgwm::Common;
 use X11::korgwm::Window;
 
+=head1 NAME
+
+X11::korgwm::Layout - window layout calculation for korgwm
+
 =head1 DESCRIPTION
 
 The idea behind this module lays in arranging the windows in a proper order.
